Error [E0605]: Public marker group `Published` contains private marker `#Private`
  --> tests/ui/marker_group_private_public.jet:3:26
    |
  3 | pub marker Published = #[Private, Inline]
    |                          ^^^^^^^
 Why: A public group cannot publish a module-private marker through expansion
 Fix: Make the member public with `pub marker`, or make the group private
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0605
